{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/b95fe77499e556d45dcbd35a845021aa.webp?t=1757990526\" width=614 height=40 /></span>Unravel the fate of the ocean as you glide across an ever changing seascape in the hopes of reuniting Toroa with their family on land.  <br><br>Following the winds of the Atua (M\u0101ori God) of the weather, T\u0101whirim\u0101tea, Toroa will befriend creatures of the sea, meet distant relatives and unravel stories of the past while flying through dream-like clouds and lush oceanic environments grounded in the M\u0101ori world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/9820f671895f48b877e65fd7994625ca.webp?t=1757990526\" width=614 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toroa have the largest wingspan in the world! Glide on wind currents and explore stylised landscapes, from calm seas to  verdant islands and into dream-like cloudscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures of the sea need your help. Chat with and befriend a colourful cast from the South Pacific including dolphins, whales, penguins and more!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade kelp with creatures to gather friends into a flock who will follow you all the way to the end of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a smorgasbord of tasty looking trash strewn about the ocean (NOT FOR CONSUMPTION) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a heartfelt story grounded in te ao M\u0101ori (the M\u0101ori world) centered on our precious ocean, family, past, present and future. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a lush soundtrack showcasing the beauty of taonga p\u016boro (M\u0101ori musical instruments) and experience the beauty of the M\u0101ori language with fully text translated dialogues and story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/49c3f03a9d4ba3519bd0cc4916aac745.poster.avif?t=1757990526\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/49c3f03a9d4ba3519bd0cc4916aac745.webm?t=1757990526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/49c3f03a9d4ba3519bd0cc4916aac745.mp4?t=1757990526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2003490?t=1757990526","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/4cb8b0ebc09805038857bd05d37eb86e18c2b566/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757990526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/b584510232e379b2549943c928b88b5aafaa4358/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757990526","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/b584510232e379b2549943c928b88b5aafaa4358/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757990526","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/b95fe77499e556d45dcbd35a845021aa.webp?t=1757990526\" width=614 height=40 /></span>Unravel the fate of the ocean as you glide across an ever changing seascape in the hopes of reuniting Toroa with their family on land.  <br><br>Following the winds of the Atua (M\u0101ori God) of the weather, T\u0101whirim\u0101tea, Toroa will befriend creatures of the sea, meet distant relatives and unravel stories of the past while flying through dream-like clouds and lush oceanic environments grounded in the M\u0101ori world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/9820f671895f48b877e65fd7994625ca.webp?t=1757990526\" width=614 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toroa have the largest wingspan in the world! Glide on wind currents and explore stylised landscapes, from calm seas to  verdant islands and into dream-like cloudscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures of the sea need your help. Chat with and befriend a colourful cast from the South Pacific including dolphins, whales, penguins and more!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade kelp with creatures to gather friends into a flock who will follow you all the way to the end of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a smorgasbord of tasty looking trash strewn about the ocean (NOT FOR CONSUMPTION) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a heartfelt story grounded in te ao M\u0101ori (the M\u0101ori world) centered on our precious ocean, family, past, present and future. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a lush soundtrack showcasing the beauty of taonga p\u016boro (M\u0101ori musical instruments) and experience the beauty of the M\u0101ori language with fully text translated dialogues and story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/49c3f03a9d4ba3519bd0cc4916aac745.poster.avif?t=1757990526\" width=600 height=